# Density Compare
# Tungsten (W) — real density 19.25 g/cm³. equal masses: Tungsten vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Tungsten Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 7.5mm material: tungsten at (-20mm, 3.7mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 153.5 g — the water cube is the reference
